title: Healthcare Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: healthcare_timer <= 0 and dem_president = 1 and dem_house = 1 and dem_senate = 1
on-arrival: healthcare_timer = 8

= Healthcare Policy

Roughly [+ uninsured +] percent of Americans lack health insurance, and costs still strain families.

- @expand_aca: Expand ACA subsidies and Medicaid
- @public_option: Create a public option
- @drug_prices: Negotiate drug prices
- @stabilize: Stabilize the current system
- @easy_discard

@expand_aca
subtitle: -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 budget.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; uninsured -= 2; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); minority_dem += 2*(1-dissent); healthcare_agenda += 1; progressive_dissent -= 3; month_actions += 1

More families get covered. Cost curves bend a little.

@public_option
subtitle: -2 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 2 budget.
choose-if: budget >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; uninsured -= 3; progressive_strength += 2; biz_relation -= 3; moderate_dissent += 3; healthcare_agenda += 2; month_actions += 1

The public option sparks a fierce lobbying fight, and passes.

@drug_prices
on-arrival: budget += 1; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); biz_relation -= 2; healthcare_agenda += 1; month_actions += 1

Seniors save; pharmaceutical lobbyists fume.

@stabilize
on-arrival: budget -= 0; uninsured -= 0.5; moderate_strength += 1; progressive_dissent += 2; month_actions += 1

We patch what exists and avoid bigger fights.
